From: AGY <defu@local.dev>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 16:54:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 21/23] feat(input): integrate ordered pending queue into TSF
 composition sessions

---
 tip/src/text_service/chewing.rs      | 63 +++++++++-----------
 tip/src/text_service/edit_session.rs | 87 ++++++++++++++++++++--------
 2 files changed, 89 insertions(+), 61 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tip/src/text_service/chewing.rs b/tip/src/text_service/chewing.rs
